{"step_index":812,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:39:29Z","content":"The certificate issuance and dedicated reverse proxy deployment are **complete and fully verified**.\n\nThe final report has been updated in the artifact:\n👉 [centreon-map-chain-report.md](file:///home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/centreon-map-chain-report.md)\n\n---\n\n### Summary of Completed Milestones\n\n1. **DNS-01 Certificate Issued via `th2-dnsp-mst1`**:\n   * Automated via passwordless SSH to `superuser@172.30.198.162:30` using `sudo pdnsutil`.\n   * Official Let's Encrypt production certificate generated for **`map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr`** (valid until December 9, 2026).\n\n2. **Dedicated Architecture on [`th2-revproxyp-fe1`](file:///etc/nginx/sites-available/03-map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf)**:\n   * Certificates installed in `/etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/`.\n   * Created [`03-map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf`](file:///etc/nginx/sites-available/03-map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf) with dedicated access/error logging and strict proxy forwarding to `172.30.198.50:9443`.\n   * Cleaned up [`02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf`](file:///etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf) so port `9443` is completely isolated.\n   * `nginx -t` passed and Nginx reloaded cleanly.\n\n3. **End-to-End Strict SSL Verification Passed**:\n   * Tested from Centreon Central (`th2-centprop-be1` — `172.30.198.49`) using `curl -sS -I https://map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr:9443/` **without `-k`**.\n   * Returned `HTTP/2 301` redirecting to `/centreon-map/` with **zero SSL certificate warnings**.\n\n---\n\n### Next Action\n\nYou can now click **\"Test connection to server\"** in Centreon Web (`Administration > Extensions > Options`). The test will validate with a green success mark."}
