{"step_index":871,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T14:07:55Z","thinking":"**Investigating CORS configuration issue**\n\nThe browser at `extranetclient` likely encounters CORS restrictions when requesting resources from `map.extranetclient`. Examining the nginx configuration for `map.extranetclient` on the reverse proxy is essential to identify if the necessary `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` headers are present and configured correctly. The configuration file needs inspection for CORS header settings. This should confirm if the origin of `extranetclient` is permitted access.\n\n\n**Verifying CORS Header Configuration**\n\nThe nginx configuration needs review to ensure it includes the correct CORS headers, specifically `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` to permit requests from `https://extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr`. The configuration either requires explicit origin specification or a wildcard origin with proper filtering. Checking the Tomcat service on the specified address for health data will give additional details, based on prior curl interactions.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"nc -zv -w 3 109.62.64.18 9443 || echo \\\"Connection to public VIP failed\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"/home/koby\"","RunPersistent":"false","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"4000","toolAction":"\"Testing workstation reachability to public VIP 9443\"","toolSummary":"\"Test reachability of 109.62.64.18:9443\""}}]}
